    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <strong>WonderLang</strong>, where mastering Italian transforms into an <strong>engaging RPG journey</strong>. Immerse yourself in captivating quests, interactive dialogues, and fun puzzles <strong>designed to make language learning seamless and enjoyable</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >WonderLang weaves language into the core of its adventure and compelling narrative. Get immersed in Wonderlang, as you: <strong>Explore</strong>, <strong>Fight</strong>, <strong>Converse</strong> and <strong>Investigate</strong> using your <strong>target language</strong>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>More affordable</strong>, <strong>more engaging</strong>, and <strong>way more fun</strong> than any subscription-based <strong>language learning app</strong>!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3460680/extras/54ca8ef42134991cf18b18b054ee353d.avif?t=1744384461\" data-has-big width=800 height=221 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >WonderLang is designed for <strong>beginner language learners</strong>, allowing you to dive into the game without any prior knowledge of the language. While the game doesn't aim to fully replace traditional language courses, it provides an <strong>immersive and enjoyable way to practice </strong>a new language gradually.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3460680/extras/939ca7fb7c6ef58353da17d0ff77dd07.poster.avif?t=1744384461\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3460680/extras/939ca7fb7c6ef58353da17d0ff77dd07.apng?t=1744384461\" class=\"bb_img\" width=100 height=98 /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immersive Italian Learning</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn practical Italian through every conversation, quest, and puzzle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progress through beginner level A1 with  <strong>40 to 50 hours of combined learning and gameplay</strong>.</p></li></ul></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Engaging Storyline</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow the journey of a young hero who must learn Italian to lift a magical curse from their brother.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore vibrant villages, uncover secrets, and build friendships interracting with over 60 unique NPCs.</p></li></ul></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3460680/extras/9b42f31feeba5491c5cea8ba1a19c19b.avif?t=1744384461\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Learning as a Gameplay Mechanic</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve puzzles, and complete quests by forming sentences and understanding dialogues.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Practice building sentences and pronunciation thanks to speech recognition challenges (On Windows only for the moment).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Utilize in-game tools like a dictionary and contextual help to aid your learning.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Spaced Repetition Combat Challenges</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in <strong>language-based combat</strong>\u00a0to reinforce language retention.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat challenges are designed using the <strong>spaced repetition principle</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3460680/extras/ccdf73f1ea974747a06efb92cb695755.poster.avif?t=1744384461\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3460680/extras/ccdf73f1ea974747a06efb92cb695755.apng?t=1744384461\" class=\"bb_img\" width=89 height=90 /></picture></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Real-World Context Practice</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Apply your Italian skills in <strong>everyday scenarios</strong> such as buying groceries or making an appointment at the doctor.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience practical vocabulary and grammar in <strong>real-world contexts</strong> to enhance your language proficiency.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0</p></li></ul></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customizable Learning Experience</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your learning journey with various difficulty settings to make the experience more or less challenging based on your preference.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set <strong>daily goals</strong> and earn rewards for reaching them, helping you build a consistent learning routine.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rich Interactive World</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore exotic locations</strong>, each introducing specific Italian vocabulary and grammar rules.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Participate in <strong>mini-games</strong> like crosswords, memory games, and charades to diversify your learning experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Demo available on our website: </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3460680/extras/6e46f68cb2492ee721f0862c735137dd.poster.avif?t=1744384461\" width=74 height=84 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3460680/extras/6e46f68cb2492ee721f0862c735137dd.webm?t=1744384461\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3460680/extras/75d0459a948d54e66fb02c8ff1cc257c.poster.avif?t=1744384461\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3460680/extras/75d0459a948d54e66fb02c8ff1cc257c.apng?t=1744384461\" class=\"bb_img\" width=73 height=107 /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Single Languages Versions are Already Out!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find them on the Franchise Page or Developper Page:</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >WonderLang French</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >WonderLang Spanish</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >WonderLang German</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >WonderLang Portuguese</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >WonderLang Italian</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Coming Soon: Korean, Japanese</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And <strong>WonderLang Polyglot, that will include all available languages, including future releases!</strong></p>",
